  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints : } 5 \\cos \\theta+12,-1 \\leq \\cos \\theta \\leq 1 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow-5 \\leq 5 \\cos \\theta \\leq 5 \\\\\n& \\therefore 5 \\cos \\theta+12 \\geq-5+12 \\Rightarrow 5 \\cos \\theta+12 \\geq 7\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
